---
---
<section class="relative pt-28 pb-20 md:pt-36 md:pb-28 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-light/80 via-brand-light/20 to-white overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Decorative background shapes -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -z-10 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-medium/10 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 transform translate-x-20 -translate-y-20"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 -z-10 w-80 h-80 bg-brand-light rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 transform -translate-x-20 translate-y-20"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-center">
      <!-- Left Content -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 text-center lg:text-left space-y-6">
        <!-- Premium Badge -->
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/10 border border-brand-primary/20 text-brand-primary text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275Z"/><path d="m5 3 1 2.5L8.5 6 6 7 5 9.5 4 7 1.5 6 4 5.5Z"/><path d="m19 17 1 2.5 2.5.5-2.5 1-1 2.5-1-2.5-2.5-1 2.5-1Z"/></svg>
          AI Asisten Guru Indonesia #1
        </div>

        <!-- Heading -->
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Akhiri Lembur Bikin Administrasi. <br />
          <span class="text-brand-primary bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-primary to-brand-dark bg-clip-text text-transparent">GuruDokAI Ultimate</span> Selesaikan dalam 2 Menit.
        </h1>

        <!-- Subheading / description -->
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 font-medium">
          <strong>Platform AI Lengkap untuk Guru Indonesia.</strong> Bukan sekadar pembuat Modul Ajar, melainkan satu aplikasi desktop untuk membantu hampir seluruh pekerjaan administrasi guru (RPP, Modul Ajar, Bank Soal HOTS, ATP, Prota, Prosem, dll) sesuai Kurikulum Merdeka.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA Buttons -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4">
          <a 
            href="https://lynk.id/oghiezr/zxjox857nz71" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-white bg-brand-primary hover:bg-brand-dark rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-brand-primary/20 hover-scale"
          >
            Coba Sekarang – Mulai 19rb
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a 
            href="#fitur" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-gray-700 bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-full shadow-sm hover-scale"
          >
            Lihat Fitur
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Social Proof -->
        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-3">
          <div class="flex -space-x-2">
            <span class="inline-block h-9 w-9 rounded-full ring-2 ring-white bg-brand-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">G</span>
            <span class="inline-block h-9 w-9 rounded-full ring-2 ring-white bg-green-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">U</span>
            <span class="inline-block h-9 w-9 rounded-full ring-2 ring-white bg-emerald-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">R</span>
            <span class="inline-block h-9 w-9 rounded-full ring-2 ring-white bg-teal-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">U</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-600 text-center sm:text-left">
            <span class="text-brand-primary font-bold">1.500+ Guru</span> di Indonesia telah mengakhiri lembur mingguan mereka!
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Dashboard Image -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[500px] lg:max-w-none">
          <!-- Decorative glow -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-primary/20 rounded-3xl blur-2xl transform rotate-3 scale-95 -z-10"></div>
          
           <!-- Image Wrapper with high quality shadow and slight tilt -->
          <div class="w-full bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-premium-lg flex flex-col h-[520px] transform hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500 lg:rotate-1 text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-700 select-none">
            <!-- Header Bar -->
            <div class="h-10 border-b border-slate-200 bg-white flex items-center justify-between px-3 shrink-0">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <!-- Logo -->
                <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded bg-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-[10px]">GD</div>
                <span class="font-extrabold text-slate-800">GuruDok<span class="text-brand-primary">AI</span></span>
              </div>
              <!-- Search -->
              <div class="relative w-28 sm:w-44">
                <input type="text" placeholder="Cari RPP..." disabled class="w-full h-6 pl-6 pr-2 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded text-[10px] focus:outline-none" />
                <svg class="w-2.5 h-2.5 text-slate-400 absolute left-2 top-1.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <!-- User profile -->
              <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-slate-700 text-[9px] border border-slate-300">BS</div>
                <span class="font-bold text-slate-600 text-[10px] hidden sm:inline">Budi Santoso</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Body -->
            <div class="flex flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-hidden">
              <!-- Sidebar -->
              <div class="w-28 bg-slate-100 border-r border-slate-200 p-1.5 flex flex-col gap-3 shrink-0 hidden sm:flex">
                <button class="bg-brand-primary text-white rounded py-1 px-1.5 font-bold text-center text-[9px] shadow-sm">
                  + Buat RPP Baru
                </button>
                <div class="space-y-1">
                  <div class="text-[8px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-400 tracking-wider px-1">Menu</div>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white border border-slate-200 font-bold text-slate-800">
                    <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-brand-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
                    Generate RPP
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-semibold text-slate-500">
                    <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"/></svg>
                    Bank Modul
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-1">
                  <div class="text-[8px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-400 tracking-wider px-1">Daftar Dokumen</div>
                  <div class="p-1 bg-brand-primary/10 border-l-2 border-brand-primary rounded text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-800">
                    <div>RPP B. Indo Kelas 4</div>
                    <div class="text-slate-400 font-normal">15 Okt 2023</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="p-1 rounded text-[8px] font-semibold text-slate-500">
                    <div>Modul Ajar IPA Kelas 5</div>
                    <div class="text-slate-400 font-normal">12 Okt 2023</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Main Workspace -->
              <div class="flex-1 bg-slate-200/40 p-2.5 flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0">
                <!-- Editor Header -->
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 shrink-0 bg-white p-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
                  <div class="font-extrabold text-slate-800 text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] truncate">Generate RPP</div>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0">
                    <button class="bg-brand-primary text-white font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[8px] shadow-sm">Simpan</button>
                    <button class="bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 text-slate-600 font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[8px] flex items-center gap-0.5">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="8" height="8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-download"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/></svg>
                      PDF
                    </button>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Editor Document Paper -->
                <div class="flex-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-3 overflow-y-auto shadow-sm max-w-full font-sans text-[8px] sm:text-[9px] leading-relaxed text-slate-800 space-y-3">
                  <!-- Document Title -->
                  <div class="text-center border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 space-y-0.5">
                    <h2 class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight">RPP Kurikulum Merdeka - Bahasa Indonesia Kelas 4 SD</h2>
                    <p class="text-[7px] sm:text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-medium">Satuan Pendidikan: SD Negeri 01 Menteng · Tahun Pelajaran: 2023/2024 · Kelas: 4 / Semester: 1</p>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Section 1 -->
                  <div class="space-y-1">
                    <div class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-[9px] border-b border-slate-100 pb-0.5">1. IDENTIFIKASI</div>
                    <div class="pl-1.5 space-y-0.5">
                      <div><span class="font-bold text-brand-primary">A. Identifikasi Murid</span>: Memetakan kebutuhan murid berdasarkan tingkat pemahaman bacaan, minat baca, serta gaya belajar (visual dan auditori).</div>
                      <div><span class="font-bold text-brand-primary">B. Identifikasi Karakteristik Materi</span>: Mengidentifikasi tingkat kesulitan gagasan pokok/pendukung cerita dan relevansi konteks narasi lokal.</div>
                      <div><span class="font-bold text-brand-primary">C. Dimensi Profil Lulusan</span>: Mandiri (bertanggung jawab atas tugasnya) dan Bernalar Kritis (menganalisis struktur informasi cerita).</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Section 2 -->
                  <div class="space-y-1">
                    <div class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-[9px] border-b border-slate-100 pb-0.5">2. DESAIN PEMBELAJARAN</div>
                    <div class="pl-1.5 space-y-0.5">
                      <div><span class="font-bold text-brand-primary">A. Tujuan Pembelajaran</span>: Murid mampu membedakan gagasan pokok dengan gagasan pendukung secara kritis dari teks narasi pendek.</div>
                      <div><span class="font-bold text-brand-primary">B. Kerangka Pembelajaran</span>:</div>
                      <div class="pl-2 space-y-0.5 text-slate-700">
                        <div><span class="font-semibold">1) Praktik Pedagogik</span>: Pembelajaran kooperatif jigsaw dengan diferensiasi proses kelompok.</div>
                        <div><span class="font-semibold">2) Pemanfaatan Digital</span>: Akses teks ajar interaktif dan lembar kerja melalui perangkat digital sekolah.</div>
                        <div><span class="font-semibold">3) Kemitraan Pembelajaran</span>: Diskusi antar teman sejawat dalam bertukar gagasan pokok.</div>
                        <div><span class="font-semibold">4) Lingkungan Pembelajaran</span>: Pengelompokan bangku fleksibel dan area membaca yang kondusif.</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Section 3 -->
                  <div class="space-y-1">
                    <div class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-[9px] border-b border-slate-100 pb-0.5">3. PENGALAMAN BELAJAR</div>
                    <div class="pl-1.5 space-y-0.5">
                      <div><span class="font-bold text-brand-primary">A. Pertemuan ke-1 (Langkah-Langkah Pembelajaran)</span>:</div>
                      <div class="pl-2 space-y-0.5 text-slate-700">
                        <div>• <span class="font-semibold">Pendahuluan (15 menit)</span>: Apersepsi dengan tanya jawab cerita lokal pendek dan penyampaian tujuan materi.</div>
                        <div>• <span class="font-semibold">Inti (70 menit)</span>: Diskusi kelompok asal dan ahli untuk menemukan gagasan pokok. Presentasi kelompok dan penguatan guru.</div>
                        <div>• <span class="font-semibold">Penutup (10 menit)</span>: Murid menyusun jurnal refleksi singkat dan guru menyampaikan tindak lanjut.</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Section 4 -->
                  <div class="space-y-1">
                    <div class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-[9px] border-b border-slate-100 pb-0.5">4. ASESMEN DAN TINDAK LANJUT</div>
                    <div class="pl-1.5 space-y-0.5">
                      <div>• <span class="font-bold text-brand-primary">Asesmen</span>: Formatif proses melingkupi rubrik keaktifan diskusi kelompok dan analisis gagasan cerita.</div>
                      <div>• <span class="font-bold text-brand-primary">Tindak Lanjut</span>: Pengayaan sinopsis cerita (mahir) & pendampingan membaca terbimbing (remedial).</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Watermark Footer -->
                  <div class="text-right text-[7px] text-slate-300 font-semibold pt-1 border-t border-slate-100">
                    Generated by GuruDokAI
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Extra floating card badge -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-premium border border-gray-50 flex items-center gap-3 hover-scale hidden sm:flex">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-primary">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check-circle-2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium">Kurikulum Merdeka</p>
              <p class="text-sm font-extrabold text-gray-900">100% Sesuai Standar</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
